            5781)
Files:      src/ops.c, src/testdir/test_put.vim

Patch 8.0.0226
Problem:    The test for patch 8.0.0224 misses the CR characters and passes
            even without the fix. (Christian Brabandt)
Solution:   Use double quotes and \<CR>.
