␀A€Î²Õ␀Æ" Vim compiler file
" Language:		Ruby
" Function:		Syntax check and/or error reporting
" Maintainer:		Tim Pope <vimNOSPAM@tpope.org>
" URL:			https://github.com/vim-ruby/vim-ruby
" Release Coordinator:	Doug Kearns <dougkearns@gmail.com>
